{"title": "Ask HN: Is anyone else struggling with AI wealth FOMO?", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313645", "summary": "<p>I’ve lately been struggling with enjoying a perfectly good life when I’m constantly reminded that other people are experiencing extraordinary financial success.<p>And that success feels…strange? I don’t know how to put words to it. Like the monetary values associated are untethered to delivering value?</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313645\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313645</a></p>\n<p>Points: 2</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>", "published": "2026-10-31T06:14:28+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Ask HN: Is anyone else struggling with AI wealth FOMO?", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313645", "published_at": "2026-10-31T06:14:28+00:00", "summary": "<p>I’ve lately been struggling with enjoying a perfectly good life when I’m constantly reminded that other people are experiencing extraordinary financial success.<p>And that success feels…strange? I don’t know how to put words to it. Like the monetary values associated are untethered to delivering value?</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313645\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313645</a></p>\n<p>Points: 2</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-10-31T06:41:17.223722+00:00"}
