{"title": "Why is Amrapali Exotica considered an elite, low-density housing society?", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313559", "summary": "<p>Amrapali Exotica stands out as a premium boutique residential project due to its rare low-density layout, with only 96 exclusive units on a small 1-acre. Amrapali Exotica minimum unit density creates a less crowded, quiet, and peaceful environment. Residents enjoy a highly private community structure with minimal foot traffic, clean common areas, and dedicated access to essential infrastructure.\nhttps://shorturl.at/mE0Y4</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313559\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313559</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>", "published": "2026-10-31T05:56:20+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Why is Amrapali Exotica considered an elite, low-density housing society?", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313559", "published_at": "2026-10-31T05:56:20+00:00", "summary": "<p>Amrapali Exotica stands out as a premium boutique residential project due to its rare low-density layout, with only 96 exclusive units on a small 1-acre. Amrapali Exotica minimum unit density creates a less crowded, quiet, and peaceful environment. Residents enjoy a highly private community structure with minimal foot traffic, clean common areas, and dedicated access to essential infrastructure.\nhttps://shorturl.at/mE0Y4</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313559\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313559</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>"}}, "logged_at