{"title": "Tell HN: Claude is using my limits even though it's infra is failing", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313539", "summary": "<p>I am using Claude design, and a lot of times it's agent is failing mid-task, with connection errors (not sure is this connection between me and agent, or between agent in Claude infra and relevant LLM model)<p>When these errors happen:<p>1. My limits have been consumed already<p>2. There is no resume button, there is only retry, which starts again<p>3. Even retry fails, then consumes my tokens.<p>I had some chats where I lost 80% my limits by retrying the task, with no luck of completing it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313539\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313539</a></p>\n<p>Points: 2</p>\n<p># Comments: 4</p>", "published": "2026-10-31T05:52:29+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Tell HN: Claude is using my limits even though it's infra is failing", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313539", "published_at": "2026-10-31T05:52:29+00:00", "summary": "<p>I am using Claude design, and a lot of times it's agent is failing mid-task, with connection errors (not sure is this connection between me and agent, or between agent in Claude infra and relevant LLM model)<p>When these errors happen:<p>1. My limits have been consumed already<p>2. There is no resume button, there is only retry, which starts again<p>3. Even retry fails, then consumes my tokens.<p>I had some chats where I lost 80% my limits by retrying the task, with no luck of completing it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313539\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50313539</a></p>\n<p>Points: 2</p>\n<p># Comments: 4</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-10-31T06:41:17.223722+00:00"}
